  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b0",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "感觉不是定级依据",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[feel_grade].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，出了事别急着拍脑袋定级——“感觉严重”不是定级的依据，定级得靠尺子量。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 7.08,
      "requestId": "0df809ae-ca37-9d46-ac5a-01f9c1fcc15f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b1",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "事故类型不等于等级",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[classify_axes].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先定性：按伤害类型这是“高处坠落”，按原因性质算“生产事故”。但记住，事故类型不等于事故等级。",
      "startSec": 7.48,
      "durSec": 9.312,
      "requestId": "324fa5f8-9aad-9666-99d7-c1148e0550a0",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b2",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "三把尺子取最高",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[highest_rule].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "定级靠三把尺子：死亡人数、重伤人数、直接经济损失。本事故死亡 1 人，没到 3 人，落“一般”档——三把尺子哪把最高就听哪把，不平均、不取最低。",
      "startSec": 17.192,
      "durSec": 14.664,
      "requestId": "7b257582-8d0b-9ff6-9d12-100a2184222b",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b3",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "报本单位负责人·30天补报",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[report_target].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "上报这步，现场人员是立即向“本单位负责人”报告，别一上来就报应急或建设单位，这是高频陷阱。再逐级上报到市级住建主管，报告含初步原因、联系人、其他；伤亡有变化，30 天内补报。",
      "startSec": 32.256,
      "durSec": 16.776,
      "requestId": "a6a60f49-0ea6-98ff-a4a5-2fba995e297f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b4",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "建议→批复→执行·双追责",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[investigation_chain].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "查事故不是单位说了算。调查组得有政府、安监、公安、监察、工会、检察院和专家。处理走调查组建议→政府批复→单位执行，单位不能自裁；既追直接责任人，也追领导责任，漏了领导责任要扣分。",
      "startSec": 49.432,
      "durSec": 18.504,
      "requestId": "5425be37-d5f9-9193-9ef1-8e465b48a929",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "b5",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "会看答案→会写成分",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "会看答案不算数，得会写成分。把这四步串成采分句，关键词一个不漏，分就拿到手了。",
      "startSec": 68.336,
      "durSec": 7.536,
      "requestId": "98fe7c33-2310-9a8f-b8cf-4b37a44bf624",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，死了1人，我咋觉得挺严重的，咋就一般事故了呢？",
      "startSec": 76.272,
      "durSec": 6.456,
      "requestId": "f9dd4c55-9db5-9927-8b35-fa0486c1801f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[grade_thresholds].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "严重不严重不归你感觉管，归三把尺子管。死亡1人没到3人，经济损失也没到1000万，就落“一般”档。别拍脑袋，量尺子。",
      "startSec": 83.128,
      "durSec": 11.328,
      "requestId": "47a24efe-1798-9357-89c4-104b7818ddd5",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，那要是死1人、可损失2000万呢？",
      "startSec": 94.856,
      "durSec": 4.968,
      "requestId": "89f10297-6e46-92d9-86e7-3dc7eb3aba5e",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[highest_rule].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "好问题。三指标任一达更高级就按更高级。2000万落“较大”档（1000万~5000万），那就按较大事故——不平均、不取最低，哪把尺子最高听哪把。",
      "startSec": 100.224,
      "durSec": 12.408,
      "requestId": "9d0a7113-22c5-97ab-93ce-19af3d891802",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，出了事我第一个电话打给谁？是打119还是报政府？",
      "startSec": 113.032,
      "durSec": 6.144,
      "requestId": "1f715640-cfb0-9288-99c9-baf0d35463ba",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[report_target].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "救人当然先救。但“报告”这步，现场人员是立即向本单位负责人报告，再由单位逐级上报到市级住建主管。一上来就报应急或建设单位，是高频陷阱，扣分。",
      "startSec": 119.576,
      "durSec": 13.104,
      "requestId": "dad3fc9f-7c8e-9346-ab14-edb71ea672d0",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 3,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "责任人是不是我们单位自己处理就行？",
      "startSec": 133.08,
      "durSec": 3.744,
      "requestId": "1eb624d9-9719-9c70-a782-16afa06f9e0f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 3,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[investigation_chain].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不行，单位不得自裁。得调查组提建议→政府批复→单位执行，而且既追直接责任人，也追领导责任，漏了领导责任照样扣分。",
      "startSec": 137.224,
      "durSec": 10.752,
      "requestId": "3cc0436a-b94e-977c-a27f-45bec84eb201",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后记住哈：先定性，再用三把尺子取最高定级，报本单位负责人逐级上报、30天补报，调查组建议政府批复、直接加领导双追责。现在开始闯关，把题干的数据放回三把尺子。",
      "startSec": 148.376,
      "durSec": 15.288,
      "requestId": "054c57cb-4724-9bef-97c5-90dc973ea226",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
